{"id":14986,"name":"Polk County","slug":"polk-county","state":"Florida","code":"FL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/florida-tax-lien-deeds-18-potential-return/polk-county/","lastUpdated":"2025-05-06T02:29:15","facts":null,"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"BCD1HdkkwSKxSM0vhEv85bG1OCj43HTPgbiNQmPBYWz5lczY2FZ4oOr9jeLFEmDa6WwtAnXxyn87\"><iframe title=\"Polk County | Florida Tax Lien &amp; Deed Investing | High ROI or Cheap Property or Both?\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AdgZe4G9omE?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-investing-in-polk-county-tax-certificates-and-deeds-for-awesome-returns\">Investing in Polk County Tax Certificates and Deeds for Awesome Returns</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Are you ready to learn how to earn up to 18% returns through Florida&#8217;s tax certificate sales?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Polk County is one of the fastest-growing counties in <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/florida-tax-lien-deeds-18-potential-return/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Florida</mark></a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\"> </mark>and ranks seventh in the United States. Young families are moving to the area, creating a significant advantage for real estate investors. Polk County&#8217;s better quality of life, lower crime rates, reduced traffic, and rich access to art and culture make it an appealing location for owning property through tax deeds.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Understanding-Tax-Certificates-and-Tax-Deeds\">Understanding Tax Certificates and Tax Deeds</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Tax Certificates:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Represent a financial claim against a property due to unpaid taxes.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Not an outright sale of the property.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Investors earn interest on the property&#8217;s tax debt.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The bidding process starts with an 18% interest rate and uses a &#8216;Bid Down&#8217; method.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It is held once a year with a two-year redemption period.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>When the property owner doesn’t repay the taxes within two years, the county sends the property to a deed auction.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Tax Deeds:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Public sale of properties with unpaid taxes to the highest bidder.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Direct transfer of property ownership.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>There is no redemption period after the auction.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Uses a &#8216;Premium Bid&#8217; method with a 5% deposit or a $200 minimum.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Tax-Lien-or-Tax-Deed-Investing-in-Polk-County\">Steps to Start Tax Lien or Tax Deed Investing in Polk County</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Research and Understand Local Laws</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Knowing the legal framework is crucial. Polk County has specific regulations for tax sales.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Visit the Local Treasurer’s Website</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>For tax lien information, visit the <a href=\"https://www.polktaxes.com/services/delinquency-and-tax-sale-information/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Polk County Tax Collector&#8217;s Office</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Check the Auction Site</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Polk County uses <a href=\"https://www.realtda.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">RealTaxLien</a> for tax certificate auctions and <a href=\"https://www.realtda.com/\">RealTDA</a> for tax deed auctions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Read the Details</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Familiarize yourself with the sale schedules, parcel inquiries, and other essential details on the county’s website.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Contact the County Office</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>For any additional inquiries, contact the <a href=\"https://www.polkcountyclerk.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Polk County Tax Collector</a> or the <a href=\"https://www.polkcountyclerk.net/\">Polk County Clerk of the Circuit Court &amp; Comptroller</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-Polk-County-Courthouse-Bartow-Florida-at-dusk-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-14989 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Old Polk County Courthouse Bartow Florida at dusk\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details-for-Polk-County\">Important Details for Polk County</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Tax Lien Certificates:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Sale Date:</strong> June</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Redemption Period:</strong> 2 years</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Interest Rate:</strong> 18%</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Bid Procedure:</strong> Bid Down</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Tax Deed Sales:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Sale Date:</strong> Every month</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Redemption Period:</strong> None</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Interest Rate:</strong> None</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Bid Procedure:</strong> Premium Bid</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Deposit:</strong> 5% of the bid or $200</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Keep Tabs on Updates:</strong> Regularly check online and local tax sale newspaper updates. Sign up for email updates and newsletters to stay ahead of upcoming sales and prime investment opportunities.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.polk-county.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Polk County Official Site</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.polktaxes.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Polk County Tax Collector&#8217;s Office</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.polkcountyclerk.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Polk County Clerk of the Circuit Court &amp; Comptroller</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://polkfl.realtaxlien.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Certificate Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.realtda.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Deed Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What is a tax lien certificate?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: A tax lien certificate is a claim against a property for unpaid taxes, allowing the investor to earn interest until the debt is paid off.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How often are tax deed auctions held in Polk County?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Tax deed auctions are held every month.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What is the interest rate for tax lien certificates in Polk County?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: The interest rate starts at 18%.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Is there a redemption period for tax deed sales?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: No, there is no redemption period for tax deed sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What is the minimum deposit required for tax deed auctions?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: A 5% deposit of the bid or a minimum of $200 is required.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Need more help? Check out our free <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Lien &amp; Deed Mini Course</mark></a> or book a call with us for a customized investing plan.</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":1}